:"Hot sand.","expt":"Areia quente."},{"w":"notice","pos":"word","pt":"reparar","ex":"Notice the order.","expt":"Repare na ordem."},{"w":"wave","pos":"word","pt":"onda","ex":"A big wave.","expt":"Uma onda grande."},{"w":"shell","pos":"word","pt":"concha","ex":"A pretty shell.","expt":"Uma concha bonita."},{"w":"leaf","pos":"word","pt":"folha","ex":"A green leaf.","expt":"Uma folha verde."},{"w":"root","pos":"word","pt":"raiz","ex":"A deep root.","expt":"Uma raiz profunda."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**What do you see?** — O que você vê?","**A big old round table.** — Uma grande mesa redonda e velha.","**Look at the lamp.** — Olhe o abajur."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"look","pt":"olhar","forms":[["I / you / we / they look","I look at the lamp."],["he / she / it looks","She looks at the book."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Describing","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Describing","lines":[["Ana","What do you see?","O que você vê?"],["Leo","A big old round table.","Uma grande mesa redonda e velha."],["Ana","Look at the lamp.","Olhe o abajur."],["Leo","A nice new lamp!","Um abajur novo e legal!"]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: do you (fala rápida)","items":[{"label":"do you (fala rápida)","note":"Na fala rápida, do you soa /dʒu/ ou /dəjə/.","words":["Do you like it?","What do you do?","Where do you live?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Describe three objects.","pt":"Descreva.","model":"A small round table. A big old book. A nice new lamp."},{"q":"Use look at.","pt":"Diga.","model":"Look at the lamp."},{"q":"Correct the order.","pt":"Corrija.","model":"A soft blue shirt."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with two adjectives.","model":"I have a small round table. She has a big old book. It is a nice new lamp. He wears a soft 